.SH NAME
anx-reset - Destroyer mode: aggressively purge and reinstall the environment from scratch


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBanx reset [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Destroyer Reinstall completely purges all managed packages, personal tools,
managed dotfiles, state databases, and caches, and rebuilds the environment fresh from declarations.
Use --uninstall-only to perform a complete Destroyer Uninstall without re-installing.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for reset

.PP
\fB--profile\fP=""
	Profile to reinstall after purge (default: developer)

.PP
\fB--uninstall-only\fP[=false]
	Execute Destroyer Uninstall without reinstalling


